---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/base.astro';
import { TypographyH1, TypographyP } from '@/components/typography';

const linkClass =
	'text-gray-400 transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:text-pure-blue hover:cursor-pointer';
---

<BaseLayout title="Hobbies" description="My hobbies and interests">
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
		<TypographyH1>Hobbies</TypographyH1>
		<TypographyP>
			I am a passionate basketball fan, keeping up with the NBA closely. My favorite team is the
			Chicago Bulls, with the New York Knicks being a close second. I also support Arka Gdynia in
			the Polish Basketball League - PLK. When I'm not watching hoops, I love playing padel, lifting
			weights, going for runs, and sailing. I enjoy spending time in the kitchen - I bake my own
			sourdough <a href="/bread" class={linkClass}>bread</a>
			at least once a week. Music is a big passion too; I'm always curating my "<a
				href="/music/top-picks"
				class={linkClass}>top picks</a
			>" of the year lists and adding new vinyl records to my
			<a href="/music/vinyls" class={linkClass}>collection</a>.
		</TypographyP>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
